---
layout: default
title: Relax harder
---

<div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <section class="grid items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] md:gap-14">
    <img src="/images/nick.jpg" alt="Nick Ostrovsky, freediving instructor, on the boat before a depth session" width="900" height="900" class="aspect-square w-full rounded-2xl object-cover md:order-2">
    <div class="md:order-1">
      <h1 class="mb-6 mt-0 text-balance text-5xl font-black leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.05em] sm:text-7xl">Relax harder.</h1>
      <p class="mb-0 text-xl leading-snug font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 sm:text-2xl">We train calm and relaxation in your own headspace. Only that.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-20 max-w-4xl sm:mt-28">
    <div class="mb-14">
      <p class="mb-3 text-3xl font-black leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-5xl">On the surface, at depth, in every style.</p>
      <p class="mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 sm:text-xl">Until that depth feels like home.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-14">
      <p class="mb-3 text-3xl font-black leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-5xl">Let everything go.</p>
      <p class="mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 sm:text-xl">The better you switch off your character, the better you dive. That is the whole secret. There is no other one.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-14">
      <p class="mb-3 text-3xl font-black leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-5xl">No fins.</p>
      <p class="mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 sm:text-xl">Just breath, body, and attention.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="mb-3 text-3xl font-black leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-5xl">One diver. One buoy.</p>
      <p class="mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 sm:text-xl">Full attention, in the pool or on the line. <a href="/why/" class="font-bold decoration-sky-200 decoration-8">What the dive does to you</a> is the same either way.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-20 grid items-start gap-10 sm:mt-28 lg:grid-cols-[390px_1fr] lg:gap-14">
    <div class="w-full max-w-[390px]">
      <blockquote class="instagram-media" data-instgrm-permalink="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DcFTJ_nv7jm/" data-instgrm-version="14"></blockquote>
    </div>
    <div class="lg:pt-6">
      <p class="mb-3 text-3xl font-black leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-5xl">My daughter is thirteen.</p>
      <p class="mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 sm:text-xl">Past ten metres you stop swimming and start to fall. Go still and you fall faster, and that is the best part of it. Five children, all of them freedivers.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="my-16 rounded-2xl border border-current/10 p-8 sm:p-10">
    <dl class="grid gap-8 text-base sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <dt class="font-black">Instructor</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Nick Ostrovsky</dd>
